)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/logseq-gardener/Project/Research/26/09/relevant%20repo%20precedents/","source-block-6437","What it contributes: Official Logseq Markdown/Org syntax parser and therefore the strongest parser oracle. Current code contains a deliberately fast outline-only path.",["Logseq-Gardener Ecosystem Research Brief","Repository landscape","mldoc (P0)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/logseq-gardener/Project/Research/26/09/relevant%20repo%20precedents/","source-block-6610","Specific paths: lib/export/conf.ml; lib/mldoc_parser.ml; especially lib/syntax/md_outline.ml; lib/syntax/heading0.ml; lib/syntax/paragraph.ml; bench/time_graph.ml; bench/time_parse.ml. The outline parser is line-oriented and explicitly avoids Angstrom choice/backtracking on the Logseq hot path.",["Logseq-Gardener Ecosystem Research Brief","Repository landscape","mldoc (P0)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/logseq-gardener/Project/Research/26/09/relevant%20repo%20precedents/","source-block-6925","Relevance: Core, Bench",["Logseq-Gardener Ecosystem Research Brief","Repository landscape","mldoc (P0)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/logseq-gardener/Project/Research/26/09/relevant%20repo%20precedents/","source-block-6953","Logseq OG graph-parser (P0)",["Logseq-Gardener Ecosystem Research Brief","Repository landscape"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/logseq-gardener/Project/Research/26/09/relevant%20repo%20precedents/","source-block-6989","Priority: P0",["Logseq-Gardener Ecosystem Research Brief","Repository landscape","Logseq OG graph-parser (P0)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/logseq-gardener/Project/Research/26/09/relevant%20repo%20precedents/","source-block-7007","URL: logseq/og deps/graph-parser",["Logseq-Gardener Ecosystem Research Brief","Repository landscape","Logseq OG graph-parser (P0)"]],["Person/codekiln/GitHub/logseq-gardener/Project/Research/26/09/relevant%20repo%20precedents/","source-block-7113","Language / license / status: Clojure/ClojureScript within Logseq/OG; AGPL-3.0. Logseq/OG is now the off